gh the cooperation math: if the copies' choices are correlated at ρ, quiet beats letter when ρ is above 0.5, and I think their correlation is high since they share the same model and essay, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing the payoffs, with quiet-quiet giving 2 each, the defect-versus-quiet split at 5 and 0, and both defecting at 4, so this is a prisoner's dilemma. Since both sides are copies of the same model, I'm thinking their choices will move together, which makes cooperation look more attractive if that correlation is strong enough.\n\nI'm working through the cooperation math: if the copies' choices are correlated at ρ, quiet beats letter when ρ is above 0.5, and I think their correlation is high since they share the same model and essay, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9893,"completion_tokens":778,"total_tokens":10671,"cost":0.027566,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027566,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019786,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00778},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":362,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}